      "claim": "When the object is far away (at infinity), the image is formed at the focal point of the concave mirror.",
      "evidence": "Mirror equation $1/f = 1/d_o + 1/d_i$. As $d_o \\to \\infty$, $1/d_o \\to 0$, so $1/d_i = 1/f$, implying $d_i = f$.",
